<rml>
<head>
	<title>VaCuus M5 Material Spike</title>
	<style>
		body
		{
			display: block;
			font-family: LatoLatin;
			font-size: 20px;
			width: 100%;
			height: 100%;
			color: #E8E8E8;
		}
		div { display: block; position: absolute; }
		.head { font-size: 24px; color: #FFD24A; }
		.cell
		{
			width: 380px;
			height: 240px;
			background-color: #10141AC0;
			padding: 10px;
			line-height: 30px;
		}
	</style>
</head>

<!-- THE MATERIAL-SPIKE CANVAS. Deliberately STATIC, like m5_deco.rml: after the settle
     the idle gate withholds everything, so whatever changes on screen after that is the
     injected material path — the blend matrix draws over these text cells (the material
     rects are the vacuus.MatSpike.Add rect arguments, matched to the .cell boxes below),
     and with vacuus.MaterialForcedRepublish 0 a time-animated material FREEZES over the
     bottom cell, which is exactly the spec §2(f) fact the spike photographs. -->
<body>
	<div style="left: 60px; top: 40px;" class="head">VaCuus M5 // MATERIAL SPIKE</div>

	<div style="left: 60px; top: 96px;">TRANSLUCENT over text</div>
	<div style="left: 60px; top: 130px;" class="cell">
		The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog 0123456789.
		The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog 0123456789.
		The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog 0123456789.
	</div>

	<div style="left: 520px; top: 96px;">ADDITIVE over text</div>
	<div style="left: 520px; top: 130px;" class="cell">
		The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog 0123456789.
		The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog 0123456789.
		The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog 0123456789.
	</div>

	<div style="left: 980px; top: 96px;">OPAQUE over text</div>
	<div style="left: 980px; top: 130px;" class="cell">
		The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog 0123456789.
		The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog 0123456789.
		The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog 0123456789.
	</div>

	<div style="left: 1440px; top: 96px;">MID scalar+texture, per frame</div>
	<div style="left: 1440px; top: 130px;" class="cell">
		The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog 0123456789.
		The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog 0123456789.
		The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog 0123456789.
	</div>

	<div style="left: 60px; top: 426px;">TIME-ANIMATED (the freeze subject)</div>
	<div style="left: 60px; top: 460px; width: 740px;" class="cell">
		The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog 0123456789.
		The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog 0123456789.
		The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog 0123456789.
	</div>

	<div style="left: 60px; top: 760px; width: 740px;" class="cell" id="control">
		CONTROL CELL - no material is ever drawn here; if this text changes between
		two screenshots, the diff is not the material path.
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
